@startuml scenario-activity
!theme plain
title User Scenario 3.1 — First Antenatal Care Contact

|#FFF3E0| Charity (Client) |
start
:Arrives at health centre\n(missed cycle, nausea);

|#E3F2FD| Abraham (Clerk) |
:Check existing records\n→ no record found;

|Charity (Client)|
:Provides demographic info\n(name, DOB, address, phone,\nPhilSys ID, PhilHealth ID);

|Abraham (Clerk)|
:Register patient in system;
note right
  **Bundle A — Registration**
  ----
  Patient (REF-20..REF-27)
  RelatedPerson (REF-28)
  Organization (REF-4..REF-7)
  Practitioner: Abraham (REF-1)
  Encounter: registration (REF-43)
end note
:Generate QR code\nfor return visits;

|Charity (Client)|
:Wait in queue;

|#E8F5E9| Jane (Nurse) |
:Call Charity into\ncounselling room;
:Close door, lower shade\n(ensure privacy);

:Ask reason for visit\n→ Chief complaint;
note right
  Observation: chief complaint
  (LOINC 10154-3)
  REF-30
end note

:Ask about LMP\n→ "around new year holiday";
:Administer pregnancy test\n→ **Positive**;

:Record working impression\n→ Pregnant (SNOMED 77386006);
note right
  Condition: pregnancy
  REF-40
end note

:Ask detailed questions:\n• Occupation\n• Smoking / caffeine\n• General health\n• Obstetric history;

:Estimate gestational age\n→ 12–15 weeks\n(exact date unknown);

:Inform: ultrasound needed\nbefore 24th week;

:Record weight & height;
:Conduct physical exam;
:Take blood pressure;
note right
  **Vital Signs (REF-32..REF-37)**
  BP: 110/70 mmHg
  HR: 78 bpm
  RR: 18/min
  SpO₂: 98%
  Temp: 36.8°C
  Weight: 55 kg
end note

:Order lab tests:\n• Diabetes screen\n• Hepatitis B\n• HIV;
note right
  ServiceRequest: lab orders
  REF-39 (partial)
end note

:Dispense IFA tablets\n(iron + folic acid, 1/day);
note right
  MedicationAdministration
  REF-38
end note

:Counsel on:\n• Reduce caffeine\n• Use condoms (STI risk)\n• Danger signs\n• Symptom management;

:Create ultrasound referral\nto Metro Imaging Centre;
note right
  **Bundle B — ANC Contact**
  ----
  ServiceRequest: ultrasound (REF-12..REF-15)
  Task: referral tracking (REF-16, REF-42)
  Organization: receiving (REF-9, REF-10)
end note

:Schedule next ANC contact;

|Charity (Client)|
:Receive referral slip\nfor imaging centre;
:Receive SMS reminder\n(if consent given);

stop

@enduml
